	<h3 id="ver-room">16.3. Room 3 bỏ hẳn <code>openHelperFactory</code></h3>

	<p>
		Room 2.x mới nhất là <strong>2.8.4</strong> (19/11/2025); Room 3 là artifact khác — <code>androidx.room3:room3-*</code>,
